 base code to which it is attached):","5":"The following diagnoses are covered for CPT codes 76376 and 76377 when performed for 3-D imaging following CPT codes 93303, 93304, 93306, 93307, or 93308 (the same ICD-10-CM code should be used as that used for the base code to which it is attached):"},"noncovered":{}}}]